WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Start from your AI assistant with nc_move, open the encrypted /connect page, and validate your Cloudflare credentials plus .bubble export in one step.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Before spending anything, inspect rebuilt pages, mobile 390px fit checks, and automatic text, button, and data parity scores in the preview viewer.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Add-ons read exact Bubble colors and fonts (#1b2a49, #faf7f0, #c4442a) cleanly: no generic widgets or mismatched stylesheets on sample previews.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Pixel-faithful visual parity: Fraunces display headings, Source Sans 3 copy, terracotta Stamp CTAs, cream ground, and zero placeholder icons.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Auth forms, card proportions, input states, and validation match or improve upon the original app across desktop and mobile viewports.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Every workspace route runs live on Cloudflare Workers, D1 SQLite, and R2 storage with crisp status badges and zero horizontal overflow on 390px phones.

7
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Edit questions, toggle required validation, publish live form links, and render crisp inline SVG QR codes with zero external requests.

8
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.500
All field types, required checks, submission state, response detail drawers, and Admin scan-quota controls work end-to-end.

9
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.500
Purchased add-ons ship production-ready: semantic dark tokens persisted in localStorage and a branded 404 fallback page on unknown URLs.
